sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Client
    participant API as App server
    participant Auth as Authorization
    participant Journal as Event journal
    participant Turn as Turn engine
    participant Context as Context compiler
    participant Router as Provider router
    participant Policy as Policy and budget gateway
    participant Egress as Provider egress gateway
    participant Model as Model provider
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox supervisor
    participant Tool as Tool, MCP, or document adapter
    participant Filter as Output validator and redactor

    User->>Client: Submit request with idempotency key
    Client->>API: thread.turn.start
    API->>Auth: Bind authenticated principal and workspace grant
    Auth-->>API: Authorized actor context
    API->>Journal: Append TurnAccepted
    Journal-->>API: Durable event sequence
    API-->>Client: Authorized event stream
    API->>Turn: Start from projected state
    Turn->>Context: Compile immutable prompt manifest
    Context->>Journal: Append ContextCompiled with hashes and token counts
    Context->>Router: Request required capabilities
    Router->>Journal: Append ProviderSelected with rationale
    Router->>Policy: Authorize provider egress, data, and cost
    Policy-->>Router: Scoped provider grant
    Router->>Egress: Canonical request and credential handle
    Egress->>Journal: Append ProviderAttemptStarted
    Egress->>Model: Stream provider request
    Model-->>Egress: Provider stream
    Egress-->>Turn: Validated canonical deltas and usage
    Turn->>Journal: Append normalized deltas

    alt Tool call proposed
        Turn->>Policy: Authorize typed operation and budget
        alt Denied by policy
            Policy->>Journal: Append ToolDenied
            Journal-->>API: Denial event
            API-->>Client: Explain denial
        else Approval required
            Policy->>Journal: Append ApprovalRequested
            Journal-->>API: Approval event
            API-->>Client: Stream bounded approval request
            User->>Client: Approve once, scoped rule, or deny
            Client->>API: Approval response
            API->>Auth: Re-authorize actor and request hash
            API->>Policy: Validated approval response
            Policy->>Journal: Append immutable decision receipt
        else Allowed
            Policy->>Journal: Append ToolAllowed
        end
        opt Effective decision is allowed
            Policy->>Sandbox: Execute with effective capability
            Sandbox->>Journal: Append OperationPrepared with fencing token
            Sandbox->>Journal: Append OperationDispatched with fencing token
            Sandbox->>Tool: Start with filtered environment and hard limits
            Tool-->>Sandbox: Bounded output, artifact, and exit status
            Sandbox->>Filter: Raw result by bounded stream
            Filter->>Journal: Append Completed, Failed, or Ambiguous
        end
        Turn->>Context: Add persisted operation outcome
        Turn->>Egress: Continue under scoped provider grant
        Egress->>Model: Stream next provider request
    end

    Model-->>Egress: Final response and usage
    Egress-->>Turn: Validated canonical final event
    Turn->>Journal: Append TurnCompleted
    Journal-->>API: Final durable events
    API-->>Client: Authorized final events
    Client-->>User: Render result and verification evidence
